ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.upgrades=Upgrades
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.upgrades=The §eDigital Miner§r is weak by default, so use the §eUpgrades§r to improve its efficiency and unlock the potential it was designed to have.\n\n

