ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.upgrades.template=Upgrade Template
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.upgrades.template=The §eUpgrade Template§r is the base of any upgrade, is made by joining:\n§r§l1§r = §sSteel Plate\n§r§l1§r = §sDiamond Plate\n§r§l2§r = §sGold Plates\n§r§l2§r = §sCoal Dusts\n§r§l2§r = §sSteel Ingots\n§r§l1§r = §sIntegrated Circuit\n\n

