ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.upgrades.speed=Speed Upgrade
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.upgrades.speed=The §eSpeed Upgrades§r increase the number of blocks that the §eMiner§r can break per second, see how to make them.\n\n

