ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.tools.hammer=Hammer
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.tools.hammer=The §eHammer§r is widely used, being easily created with §s2 Sticks§r and §s2 Iron Ingots§r in a Crafting Table.\n\n

### Main/Craft/Ore
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.ore=Ore
