ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.ore.dust.coal=Coal Dust
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.ore.dust.coal=The §eCoal Dust§r is made by joining §s1 Hammer§r and §s1 Coal§r in a Crafting Table.\n\n

