ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.ore.dust.iron=Iron Dust
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.ore.dust.iron=The §eIron Dust§r is made by joining §s1 Hammer§r and §s1 Raw Iron§r in a Crafting Table.\n\n

### Main/Craft/Ore/Dust/Steel
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.ore.dust.steel=Steel Dust
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.ore.dust.steel=The §eSteel Dust§r is made by joining §s1 Iron Dust§r and §s1 Coal Dust§r in a Crafting Table.\n\n

### Main/Craft/Ore/Dust/Gold
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.ore.dust.gold=Gold Dust
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.ore.dust.gold=The §eGold Dust§r is made by joining §s1 Hammer§r and §s1 Raw Gold§r in a Crafting Table.\n\n

