### Main/Change Log
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.change_log=Change Log
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.change_log=See the changes that have occurred in this addon.\n\nCurrent addon version: v1\n\n

### Main/Change Log/Version 1.0
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.change_log.version_1.0=Version 1.0
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.change_log.version_1.0=§l> Added:§r\n- Digital Miner now considers custom chests as a valid container;\n- Added a craft to Anchor Upgrade;\n- Added the chunk load function to Anchor Upgrade;\n- Digital Miner will save your settings and upgrades when you break it;\n\n§l> Changed:§r\n- Change Diamond Glass texture;\n\n§l> Fixed:§r\n- Fixed some words on the change log panel;\n- Fixed Diamond Glass render (now you can use it in your builds);\n\n§l> Removed:§r\n- Removed the energy upgrades;\n- Removed some spawn eggs from creative inventory;\n\n

### Main/Change Log/Version 0.4
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.change_log.version_0.4=Version 0.4 Alpha
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.change_log.version_0.4=§l> Additions:§r\n- Added a list to select the type of blocks in the world;\n- Added a list to select the tags registered;\n- Added Stack Upgrade Tier 1-4;\n- Added Fortune Upgrade Tier 1-3;\n- Added Silk Touch Upgrade Tier 1;\n\n§l> Changes:§r\n- Optimized the Scanning Method;\n- Changed the method of scanning from Layers to Chunks;\n- Speed Upgrades now reduces the time between executions;\n- Changed some translations.\n\n

### Main/Change Log/Version 0.3
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.change_log.version_0.3=Version 0.3 Alpha
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.change_log.version_0.3=§l> Additions:§r\n- Added a Guidebook;\n- Added a Settings Panel to change the Radius and Height range;\n- Added a craft to transform 1 Steel Plate into 3 Steel Block;\n- Added a craft to transform 1 Gold Plate into 3 Gold Block;\n- Added a craft to transform 1 Diamond Plate into 1 Gold Plate and 8 Diamond Dust;\n- Added a sound when enable and disable the Digital Miner;\n- Added some icons on the Miner Interface;\n- Added a Guidebook;\n- Added speed Upgrades;\n- Added a custom tag system;\n\n§l> Changes:§r\n- Changed the Diamond Glass to use 8 Diamond Dust;\n- Changed the defaul speed to 1 block per second (increases with upgrades);\n- Changed some translations;\n\n§l> Removed:§r\n- Removed vanilla tags as valid tags, because the game doesn't have many useful tags;\n\n§l> Fixed:§r\n- Fixed a problem where adding a new type or tag didn't take you back to the filters screen;\n- Fixed a problem when you try to place a Digital Miner at the world's build limit;\n- Fixed some incorrect translations.\n\n

### Main/Change Log/Version 0.2
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.change_log.version_0.2=Version 0.2 Alpha
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.change_log.version_0.2=§l> Additions:§r\n- Added addon identifier to blocks and items;\n- Added Steel Nuggets, Steel Block and Steel Plate;\n- Added Monitor, Integrated Circuit and Capacitor;\n- Added Diamond Glass;\n- Added Diamond and Gold Dust;\n- Added Diamond and Gold Plate;\n- Added Redstone Enriched Quartz;\n- Added Advanced Circuit and Digital Processor;\n- Added Laser Drill and Light Generator;\n- Added Machine Engine;\n- Added Ore Scanner;\n\n§l> Changes:§r\n- Now Steel and Iron Dust can be smelting in a Blast Furnace;\n- Steel Dust result in a Steel Nugget now;\n- Changed Steel Ingot recipe to use Steel Nuggets;\n- Changed Digital Miner recipe to use the new items;\n- Changed counting message to only show the progress;\n- Optimized the system for find blocks;\n\n§l> Fixed:§r\n- Fixed the issue with counting blocks that could duplicate;\n- Fixed the problem that prevented the Miner interface from opening through the central block;\n\n§l> Known Bug:§r\n- Block Outline may not work on ores that are very close to water.\n\n

### Main/Change Log/Version 0.1
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.change_log.version_0.1=Version 0.1 Alpha
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.change_log.version_0.1=§l> Additions:§r\n- Added a Digital Miner;\n- Added a Hammer;\n- Added coal, iron and steel dust;\n- Added Steel Ingot;\n- Added a configurable filters to Digital Miner.\n\n



